MIC2\0DMIC3_OUTPUT\0VA SWR_MIC3\0DMIC4_OUTPUT\0VA SWR_MIC4\0DMIC5_OUTPUT\0VA SWR_MIC5\0DMIC6_OUTPUT\0VA SWR_MIC6\0DMIC7_OUTPUT\0VA SWR_MIC7\0DMIC8_OUTPUT";
